<title>USA: J.C. Penney Nov same store sales rise.</title>
<headline>J.C. Penney Nov same store sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>PLANO, Texas 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 1995     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month	 $2,014     $1,926	 4.5	 2.5</p>
<p>Year-to-date$12,419    $11,958	3.9	 2.2</p>
<p>    Month is  five weeks ended Nov 30.</p>
<p>Full company name is J.C. Penney Co Inc</p>
<p>Total company sales $2,886 versus $2,717 for five week period. Total company sales $17,382 vs $16,648 year to date.</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
